OL,3,ASecond day of mushroom murderer Erin
OL,4,APatterson's appeal hearing under way in
OL,5,AMelbourne
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the matter continues on Thursday,
OL,8,Fthe court will also hear an appeal from
OL,9,Fprosecutors who argue Patterson's
OL,10,Fsentence is "manifestly inadequate" as
OL,11,Fit allows for the possibility of parole
